    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, make principles in relation to the matching of information under subsection 132B(1) by:  (a) the Chief Executive Medicare; and  (b) an authorised Commonwealth entity.  (2) Without limiting subsection (1), the principles must:  (a) require the Chief Executive Medicare to establish and maintain a publicly available register of the kinds of information matched by the Chief Executive Medicare or an authorised Commonwealth entity under subsection 132B(1); and  Schedule 1  Data-matching" ;
