concept:health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019-sch-2-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 After paragraph 106U(1)(cb)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (d) that any amount for treatment under a relevant DVA law that would otherwise be payable for a service in the provision of which the person is stated in a report under section 106L to have engaged in inappropriate practice ceases to be payable;  (da) if an amount has been paid (whether or not to the person under review) for treatment under a relevant DVA law relating to a service:  (i) that was rendered or initiated by the person under review or an associated person; and  (ii) in connection with the rendering or initiation of which the person under review or an associated person is stated in a report under section 106L (other than a report based on a finding made under subsection 106K(2) or 106KB(3)) to have engaged in inappropriate practice;  Other amendments  Schedule 2 Professional Services Review Scheme  Part 1  No. 121, 2019 Health Legislation Amendment (Data-matching and Other Matters) Act  that the person under review repay to the Commonwealth the whole or a part of the amount paid for that service;" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (d) that any amount for treatment under a relevant DVA law that would otherwise be payable for a service in the provision of which the person is stated in a report under section 106L to have engaged in inappropriate practice ceases to be payable;  (da) if an amount has been paid (whether or not to the person under review) for treatment under a relevant DVA law relating to a service:  (i) that was rendered or initiated by the person under review or an associated person; and  (ii) in connection with the rendering or initiation of which the person under review or an associated person is stated in a report under section 106L (other than a report based on a finding made under subsection 106K(2) or 106KB(3)) to have engaged in inappropriate practice;  Other amendments  Schedule 2 Professional Services Review Scheme  Part 1  No. 121, 2019 Health Legislation Amendment (Data-matching and Other Matters) Act  that the person under review repay to the Commonwealth the whole or a part of the amount paid for that service;"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3cb8cd08e22e01b11c6c23a9141845056421c4efda41b451be777ad9814d3648" ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ceases payment of amount for treatment under relevant DVA law" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
